                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Italian Colonies</hi></p>
                <p>The Council considered document C.F.M.(46) 221<anchor n="43" xml:id="d277-f1"/>
                    on the Italian Colonies.</p>
                <p>The English text of this document was adopted.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Germany</hi></p>
                <p>Views were exchanged on the problem of Germany.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III. <hi rendition="#italic">Austria</hi></p>
                <p>Views were exchanged on the problem of Austria.</p>
                <pb facs="0941" n="917" xml:id="pg917"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">IV. <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>Friday, July 12, at 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>Agenda—Continuation of the discussion on Austria.</p>
